    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="f54c4fc5-2f84-5392-80e9-29f0fcab249f" activityNameId="521a91f3-d59f-5644-bf00-59755b999bde" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cupboard hinges and screws, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cupboard hinges and screws, at plant
na;
UUID: fa046af5-bb24-3b09-92eb-b82f57b72836
This data set describes the production of cuboard hinges, screws, drawer rails and handels for the kitchen. The tall cupboard requires 4 hinges, whereas the bottom and top section need each 2 hinges per cupboard, total 30 hinges are required (steel, 90 g each). Each hinge needs 2 screws (steel, 0.0009 g each) There are 6 drawers with drawer rails (steel, 1.11 kg per drawer) and each drawer needs 24 screws for its rails. All 20 cupboards and drawers have handles (chromium steel, 60 g each) that need 2 screws each. Transport to the construction site is not included. All metallic components are recycled at the end of life.; Geography: Data valid for Switzerland
Location:  Data valid for Switzerland
Technology: Average disposal
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fa046af5-bb24-3b09-92eb-b82f57b72836.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
